  "_note": "C01 grid scenarios shared by reference/tests (Python), tests/unit/test_G01_power_grid.gd (Godot) and tools/cross_check_reference.py. Re-derived from blueprint pp. 6-7 and 37 (SIM IDs); not the original oracle. Steps are commands or '@macro' names. Each command expects 'ok' or a refusal code; a refused command must leave the canonical hash unchanged.",
